        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konke okungcwelisiwe kwa-Israyeli kuyakuba ngokwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konke okuvula isizalo kuyo yonke inyama abayiletha kuJehova, kubantu noma kweyezilwane, kuyakuba ngokwakho;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abahlengwayo kusukela kwabanenyanga uyakuyihlenga ngokulinganisa kwakho imali yamashekeli ayisihlanu ngokweshekeli lendlu engcwele, amagera angamashumi amabili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha izibulo lenkomo noma izibulo lemvu noma izibulo lembuzi awuyikulihlenga; bangcwele; ufafaze igazi lazo e-altare, ushise amanoni azo, abe ngumnikelo womlilo, ube yiphunga elimnandi kuJehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
