              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasisithi kuAroni: Kawuyikuba lelifa elizweni labo, njalo kawuyikuba lesabelo phakathi kwabo; mina ngiyisabelo sakho lelifa lakho phakathi kwabantwana bakoIsrayeli.",
