              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhekani, ngibanika abantwana bakwaLevi konke okweshumi kwa-Israyeli kube yifa lenkonzo yabo abayikhonzayo, inkonzo yetende lokuhlangana.",
          "type": "text",
