              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa amaLevi kumelwe enze umsebenzi wenkonzo yetende lokuhlangana, futhi kumelwe athwale ububi bawo; kuyakuba yisimiso esiphakade ezizukulwaneni zenu, ukuze zingabi nafa phakathi kwabantwana bakwa-Israyeli.",
