              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha okweshumi kwabantwana bakwa-Israyeli abakulethayo kube ngumnikelo wokuphakanyiswa kuJehova, ngakunika amaLevi njengefa; ngalokho ngathi kubo: “Phakathi kwabantwana bakwa-Israyeli abayikuba nafa.",
