              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yisho kumaLevi, uthi kuwo: ‘Uma nithatha kubantwana bakwa-Israyeli okweshumi engininike khona kubo njengefa lenu, niyakuletha kukho umnikelo wokuphakanyiswa kuJehova, okweshumi kokweshumi.",
