            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngalokho niyakuletha umnikelo wokuphakanyiswa kuJehova kukho konke okweshumi kwenu enikwamukela kubantwana bakwa-Israyeli; futhi kumelwe unike u-Aroni umpristi umnikelo kaJehova.",
          "type": "text",
