              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuzo zonke izipho zenu nilethe yonke iminikelo yokuphakanyiswa yeNkosi, kukho konke okuhle kakhulu kwayo, okungcwele kwayo.",
          "type": "text",
